{"server":"tw","storyId":"act15side_level_act15side_03_end","groupId":"act15side","stageId":"act15side_03","title":"光與影","storyCode":"IW-3","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act15side/level_act15side_03_end.txt","sourceHash":"72cf17950f8dde14248b39d6ddcb6babd30c89c4c0e6927f7a940c72f5bb2a34","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"杜小姐與鄭掌櫃的父女矛盾爆發，慎師傅也陪著老鯉尋山訪水。太合前來試探梁洵，而寧小姐與一位神秘的挑山人，也闖入局中。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"3下"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g09_teahouse"},{"type":"narration","text":"晌午，晴，彷彿前一日的風雨欲來只是個不痛不癢的玩笑。\n尚蜀三山十七峰，第二高山，是居奇山。而居奇山只有二峰，其中第二高的峰，即是泥泥峰。\n泥泥峰又有二千二百二十二級台階，本來沒這麼湊巧，是為了取個噱頭，後來特地加算進去的。\n臺階向天，穿雲踱霧。愈往高處，遊客越少，人蹤漸薄，徒留青山。\n而零星可見的身影，一眼望去，皆是挑夫。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茶館歇腳人","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然比不得天嶽，可當真是一座高峰啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茶館歇腳人","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你說這些修不得公路的半山腰上，是怎麼建起一家家茶館涼亭的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茶館觀光客","speakerId":"avg_npc_304_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，能怎麼建，靠人力囉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茶館觀光客","speakerId":"avg_npc_304_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咱們上來的時候，不是看見一個挑夫走下山去嘛？他們每天就這一趟趟的，小到乾糧茶水，大到石磚青瓦，不都是挑上來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茶館觀光客","speakerId":"avg_npc_304_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聽說他們一趟路要爬個好些時辰，辛苦得很。就算到了今天，有些偏僻山頭啊，還是離不開挑夫......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茶館歇腳人","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就不能拉個索道，或者起個吊車之類的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茶館觀光客","speakerId":"avg_npc_304_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那也得先有個施工的地方吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茶館歇腳人","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也對，不過我也不太明白這是怎麼弄的......不過他們還真了不起啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茶館歇腳人","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們應該賺挺多吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茶館觀光客","speakerId":"avg_npc_304_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以前不多，不過前段時間看新聞說，尚蜀知府非常重視這些賣力氣的，甚至這些茶館的茶水都是政府掏錢免費提供的......呃？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......抱歉，讓讓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"晌午茶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茶館夥計","speakerId":"avgnew_npc_140_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好的，尚師傅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茶館夥計","speakerId":"avgnew_npc_140_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最近怎麼樣？有幾天沒見著你了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不怎麼樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茶館夥計","speakerId":"avgnew_npc_140_1","isRemote":false,"text":"做什麼去了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看望我兒子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茶館夥計","speakerId":"avgnew_npc_140_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......又到了這個時候啦......我都忙忘了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茶館夥計","speakerId":"avgnew_npc_140_1","isRemote":false,"text":"尚師傅早點打聲招呼，我們可以陪著去的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......算了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他喜歡清靜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茶館夥計","speakerId":"avgnew_npc_140_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，都過去好多年啦......我是和你熟悉，才和你說這些話，你別介意啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茶館夥計","speakerId":"avgnew_npc_140_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人總是要向前看的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你在替鄭清鉞說話？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茶館夥計","speakerId":"avgnew_npc_140_1","isRemote":false,"text":"廢話，我們這家店都是鄭掌櫃投資的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拿人錢，替人說話，那我就不怨你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茶館夥計","speakerId":"avgnew_npc_140_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也有一半是真心話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那我怨你一半。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茶館夥計","speakerId":"avgnew_npc_140_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼多年了，多勸你一句不多，少勸你一句不少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茶館夥計","speakerId":"avgnew_npc_140_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好好喝茶，好好想想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茶館歇腳人","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我們剛才在山路上，是不是看見過那人下山？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茶館觀光客","speakerId":"avg_npc_304_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是、是啊？這才多久？爬回來了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"茶館觀光客","speakerId":"avg_npc_304_1","isRemote":false,"text":"應該是路上遇到同事，接了個力吧......不然這才半個時辰，就從半山腰到這兒走了個來回？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g11_yanroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不行，聯繫不上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"通訊沒有反應，就說明年和夕還不在尚蜀地界......也可能他們根本沒有按照行動守則行動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......恩人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我知道你要說什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然我不是什麼過目不忘的聰明人，可我要是沒看錯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鯉先生交給梁先生的那個匣子，和那位年小姐當時手裡的東西，是一個圖樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"果然和她們倆的突然離隊有關。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恩人，我們怎麼辦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......其實我也不是沒有預料到這個情況。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我和小炎熔說好啦，等她到了辦事處，立刻聯絡尚蜀附近的幹員來接我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃？原來恩人早有準備？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就猜到年一路上鬼鬼祟祟的，準沒好事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那意思是，我們果然還是先留在這裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然這麼巧遇上了鯉先生，自然是要幫忙的。合約上是這麼寫的嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原來如此，恩人秉公辦事，兢兢業業，令人欽佩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......可畢竟鯉先生是個聰明人。客棧偶遇之後，他一直沒開口請求羅德島的協助，也許本來就是在暗示我們不必摻和此事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但如果事情真的和年有關......再加上那個太合和左樂說的話......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"總之，到時先去約定好的地點瞧瞧。雖然我想年多半不會守約，但夕不是那樣的人。說不定能見她一面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說的是，夕小姐應該會透露一些線索吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不管怎麼想，有些事情也實在是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——實在是太巧了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小烏有，你選那家客棧落腳，總不能是別有用心吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恩人說笑了，就算我別有用心，我也沒能耐指使鉗獸掀了我的車，再恰巧撞上恩人啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那究竟是誰，能讓這件事巧得不能再巧了呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......恩人，您剛才應該是開玩笑的吧，是開玩笑的吧？不是真懷疑我吧？恩人！？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g04_yaninn"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鄭掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......怎麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這件事不是應該全部交給我負責嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鄭掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"總得有人收拾爛攤子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爹能做到的，我分明也能——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鄭掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"錯了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鄭掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你就算能，也不能。只要你還是杜遙夜，不是杜鏢頭，就絕對不行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鄭掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爹為什麼在客棧時沒有甕中捉鼈，還特地制止你？你難道猜不到？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是那個身手了得的卡特斯，和那個叫烏有的——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鄭掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那看來你還沒到火候。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......什麼火候？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鄭掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"識人的火候。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爹！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您究竟是想讓我繼承您的位置，還是想讓我一輩子當那個不諳世事的杜大小姐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鄭掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......鏢師多結仇。你不明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我要當那個紈絝可笑、不明事理的大小姐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要讓所有人相信，那個鄭大鏢頭已經是個踏踏實實做生意的老頭子，而我，不過是扶不上牆的繼承人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可那終歸不是我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鄭掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......夜兒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您知道現在鏢局年輕人對您有多大意見嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鄭掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們懂什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......您又懂什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鄭掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"火急火燎想當甩手掌櫃，卻看不到多少年輕一輩早就對鏢局現狀怨聲載道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鄭掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那你憑良心告訴爹，和那群不成器的徒弟一起自立門戶，就是你真正想做的事情了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鄭掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在這個你，就是你了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只知道，這件事，爹是讓我辦的。辦成了，就能服眾，還能做成一件大事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鄭掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我怕你做不好這件事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鄭掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"更怕你存心做不好這件事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我不懂爹在說什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那如果爹您改了主意，請趕緊告訴我，如果沒有，那麼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就請您別管我的事了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g02_yanalley_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"街頭青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......杜小姐，情況怎麼樣？掌櫃的怎麼說？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，能怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鄭老頭讓人給耍了，那夥人早早做好了調包。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"街頭青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看用不著我們故意把事情搞砸，掌櫃的自己就能玩砸了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我看未必。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他意識到我們的想法了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"街頭青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊、啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"街頭青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他知道了？那怎麼辦？師傅們要是罰我們禁足，不就什麼都做不了了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......要迅速解決問題，很麻煩。可要是迅速製造問題，總是不難的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g06_mountainroad_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"早年遊覽尚蜀就感歎過一番，尚蜀百姓實在是有本事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從新巒區到流雲區，需要繞過多少座奇峰險峻？城區分散在山巒之中，煙火更是遍佈山間，奇景奇景，妙哉妙哉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......先前搶你物件的那件事，你弄明白了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也不傻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是我相信梁洵，所以信得過慎師傅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，你算活成人精了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"梁洵是這麼說我的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是我自己以為的。怎麼會想到梁大人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他以前說過我，說我裝模作樣，算天天不準，測地地不靈，唯獨誰都說叵測的人心，我每一次都能矇得準。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這就叫活成人精了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......經驗罷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接著走吧。這座昏譚峰就這麼點大，一路走來，確實沒見著過什麼亭子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"取江峰不遠，可為什麼要選那座山頭？要找人，直接去人家最多的地方不好嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"取江峰以前叫什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"攥江峰。名字難寫難記，後來要開發成景區，就改名了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就是了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我做了一個怪夢，夢裡，我在那山峰頂上尋人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......還有這種神奇的事？是鯉小子你以前來尚蜀的時候聽說過這個古名？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也許吧......或者說......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":".....說不定是有仙人指路呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你會用法術吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在是叫源石技藝了？文縐縐的名字，這類東西，擱在很久以前，不就和神仙鬼怪差不多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這就不對了，慎師傅。符籙為人驅使，乃人定勝天之道。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_light"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉？","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人定勝天之道？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉？","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我喜歡這句話。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g06_mountainroad_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，源石技藝，源石技藝，真是不太懂現在這些源石研究的門道......嗯？幹嘛愣在原地？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剛才......我說了什麼嗎......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人定勝天？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......沒什麼，當我發白日夢了吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g11_yanroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......取江峰，攥江峰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們分明幾次探尋，可還是毫無線索。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......理所當然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"司歲台還是下定了決心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可她......在尚蜀的她，真在歷史上有過什麼大是大非嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她當年又為何願意為大炎出力，參軍戍邊數十載？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"歲月悠悠，絕非常理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可眼下之事似乎事與願違，梁先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......如果她是影子，那從龍門帶來的酒盞，就是火光了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵......先有光還是先有影，真是個無意義的難題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"難在解題人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"司歲台親自找我，曉之以理動之以情，我當然明白輕重。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你本答應左將軍，酒盞抵達尚蜀後，便佯裝遭劫，送與左公子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......以此瞞過某些人的眼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我總不能一五一十地告訴老鯉他一個外人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你就不該選那個龍門人來替你做這件事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是礙於身份，不可貿然行事，萬一影響尚蜀的早春煙火，得不償失。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然我在尚蜀為官，一磚一瓦，都是大事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可那個龍門人不是你的朋友嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是我的朋友。但也是外人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......人多眼雜，不怨梁先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"酒盞如今？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既要托我那友人，酒盞自然在他的身上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"梁大人打算假手於人，讓那龍門人找出令之所在？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"傳言那盞能附靈於周遭器物，當真無事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......太合先生，我也有一事相問。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你我放下官階立場，平心而論。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這次司歲台可是繞過禮部，激進行事，大有越俎代庖之嫌。事後禮部反應過來，免不了一番唇槍舌劍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你既是肅政院副監察御史，對此作何想？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"將軍於我有恩，太合知恩圖報而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那就是私情了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不錯，私情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"肅政院監察御史，體察百官，肅整朝儀，似乎與私情這個詞，相去甚遠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那若是肅政院得知此事詳情後，覺得禮部才合情理，司歲台大錯特錯，私情又怎麼辦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"取忠捨義。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......太合先生回答得很果斷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"教我這四個字的，正是將軍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......大丈夫，當如是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過梁先生大可不必擔憂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"左將軍既然是大炎軍人，絕不會擅行有違律法之事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是有人讓司歲台如此作為？哪怕越過禮部那些人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也對......誰能讓平祟侯左宣遼不去勞心邊疆事務，特地來操勞這區區一件酒盞？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說小不小，說大不大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至於是誰，心知肚明便是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嘶......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"梁先生保重身體。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......今年尚蜀的早春，還是比預想的冷些。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g05_mountaincity_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"取江峰周邊，除了一些散戶，就這一個鎮子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......這是個怎麼樣的地方？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"早在尚蜀城市尚未建立的時候，這裡臨近邊疆，山脈礦藏豐富，有許多鐵匠和雕石匠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......世道太平，移動城市也開進了群山之中，除了被當作景點保留下來的一些大鍛爐，剩下的都成了民宿了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"慎師傅，那這取江峰上......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......這就沒印象了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......也許只是個觀棋飲酒的去處？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟若是什麼名勝之地，那也輪不到我來找了，多半還得是那種地處偏僻、無人問津的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......尚蜀山水我也算熟稔得很了，還從未聽說過取江峰有什麼無人問津的亭子的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"取江峰的山頂，只有偌大一片空地。傳說有神人在此悟得臨淵忘水之道，所以人稱“忘水坪”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是嗎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那這找人的活兒，可難辦多了......不如從酒鋪下手？可梁洵又說不知道那人模樣，問了也白問......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"慎師傅，有何高見？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"找人嘛，自古以來都只有一個方法最簡單。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就是讓那個人來找你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有道理，可惜這道理有些缺乏能動性。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過我倒是有個想法——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......唔。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......怎麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑山人","speakerId":"avg_npc_302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有事？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g11_yanroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......寧小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"梁大人有雅興，這時候還看閒書。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"閒書總是多多益善的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"寧小姐有話便說就是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"梁大人最近，是不是遇上了什麼麻煩？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......寧小姐是指？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的那位龍門朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是有些麻煩事，瞞不過寧小姐的眼，私事罷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"關於什麼的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"找人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......找什麼人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一位我與他的故友，是個武林中人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......只是個武林中人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"姓槐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就這件小事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我一早就說了，是一件......小事，不勞寧小姐費心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"梁大人可不該瞞我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我有什麼好瞞你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"narration","text":"眼前的女子在房間踱步，掃視書架，彷彿有一種失落的情緒籠罩四周。\n所幸很快，她又提起了興致。\n她的情緒總是這般變化很快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......梁大人手裡那本閒書，是本歷史傳記？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......說的是過去在這尚蜀三山地界，發生的一場天災。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"梁大人很喜歡那段歷史。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"親眼所見，終生難忘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我記得是叫......《三山談》？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"寧小姐倒是記得清楚，看來我翻這些書，次數有些多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......偶然留意而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有空把它借我一閱吧，我好在一會拜訪白叔叔的時候，打發打發時間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請便。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好......不過......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......啊，抱歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我來取吧，因為近日看得少，放在高處了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，謝謝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"寧小姐一會就要去白陶工那兒？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那還請寧小姐替我向他問好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我先去了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g10_lianghouse"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......《三山談》。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"梁大人也不會想到，其實那次你熬夜伏案，睡著在書房，我已經偷偷翻過這些閒書打發時間了吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（這本書......本來不放在那上面的。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（那麼原本書架上多出的那個盒子......裝的又是什麼呢？）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
